,{"latestBlog":102},[103,106,109,112,115],{"title":104,"slug":105},"港式英语，勉强算英语吧","hongkong-english-accent",{"title":107,"slug":108},"显微镜下的大明之丝绢案","under-the-microscope",{"title":110,"slug":111},"用chatGPT学俄语","chatgpt-teaches-russian",{"title":113,"slug":114},"夏洛克·福尔摩斯和H·H·福尔摩斯：其实没什么关系","sherlock-holmes-and-h-h-holmes",{"title":116,"slug":117},"手疼的时候想到八佰伴","oshin-and-yaohan",{"id":119,"title":120,"body":121,"categories":273,"description":274,"extension":275,"meta":276,"navigation":96,"path":278,"seo":279,"slug":280,"stem":281,"tags":282,"__hash__":286},"blog\u002Fblog\u002F2020-05-01-enable-spellcheck-on-chrome-en.md","How to enable spell check on Chrome",{"type":122,"value":123,"toc":267},"minimark",[124,129,133,141,144,147,158,162,165,176,200,203,219,222,226,232,246,252,255,261],[125,126,128],"h2",{"id":127},"annoying-typos-driving-me-mad","Annoying typos driving me mad",[130,131,132],"p",{},"I have been writing blog articles with both Chinese and English versions since April, and I can always find a lot of typos after posting the English version.",[130,134,135,136,140],{},"Also I've been using this ",[137,138,139],"code",{},"CMS"," that I built on my own, the editor just wouldn't show any spelling mistakes for me.",[130,142,143],{},"But the browser used to check spellings, when has it stopped?",[130,145,146],{},"I started searching some programming ways to solve it, but they won't work, then I tried searching only Chrome-related keywords, and found the solution.",[130,148,149,150,157],{},"This ",[151,152,156],"a",{"href":153,"rel":154},"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.reddit.com\u002Fr\u002Fchrome\u002Fcomments\u002F6ztplx\u002Fcant_enable_spell_check_in_chrome\u002F",[155],"nofollow","reddit discussion"," is the key solution that I found.",[125,159,161],{"id":160},"can-it-be-solved-with-codes","Can it be solved with codes?",[130,163,164],{},"Yes, and no.",[130,166,167,168,171,172,175],{},"If spellcheck is enabled on Chrome, you can control whether to allow this feature by setting ",[137,169,170],{},"spellcheck=\"true\""," or ",[137,173,174],{},"spellcheck=\"false\""," for specific elements on your website or web apps.",[130,177,178,179,182,183,185,186,189,190,193,194,199],{},"And unlike other ",[137,180,181],{},"true\u002Ffalse"," attributes, if you want it enabled, you have to address it explicitly with ",[137,184,170],{}," , like this ",[137,187,188],{},"\u003Cinput type=\"text\" spellcheck=\"true\"\u002F>",", rather than just write down the attribute name, like ",[137,191,192],{},"\u003Cinput type=\"text\" spellcheck\u002F>",". You can find some explanations ",[151,195,198],{"href":196,"rel":197},"https:\u002F\u002Fdeveloper.mozilla.org\u002Fen-US\u002Fdocs\u002FWeb\u002FHTML\u002FGlobal_attributes\u002Fspellcheck",[155],"here",".",[130,201,202],{},"But if it is disabled on Chrome, the codes are just useless, you will not be able to turn it on by force.",[130,204,205,206,210,211,214,215,218],{},"By ",[207,208,209],"em",{},"disabled",", I don't mean that you might really have clicked a button called ",[137,212,213],{},"disable spellcheck",", it's possible that you just haven't ",[207,216,217],{},"enabled"," the right setting. Believe me, I've been there too.",[130,220,221],{},"I'm a Chinese speaker, but I can also read Japanese and some Korean, so I added Japanese and Korean to browser language setting to stop Chrome translating Japanese and Korean pages. And I might have changed something that I shouldn't change at that time.",[125,223,225],{"id":224},"lets-set-it-right-on-chrome","Let's set it right on Chrome",[130,227,228,229],{},"Go to ",[137,230,231],{},"three dots > Settings > Advanced > Languages > Spell Check",[130,233,234,235,238,239,171,242,245],{},"If you only see a language ",[137,236,237],{},"English"," but without specific country name in parenthesis next to it, like ",[137,240,241],{},"English(United Kingdom)",[137,243,244],{},"English(United States)",", then you will see this message:",[247,248,249],"blockquote",{},[130,250,251],{},"checkSpell check isn’t supported for the languages you selected.",[130,253,254],{},"So please add those languages with country names in parenthesis and enable spellcheck for these languages, then your wavy red underline will be back and working.",[130,256,257],{},[258,259,260],"strong",{},"Shortcut",[130,262,263,264,199],{},"Go to any input box or textarea box, type anything, right click on any word, then go to ",[137,265,266],{},"Spell check > Language settings",{"title":268,"searchDepth":34,"depth":34,"links":269},"",[270,271,272],{"id":127,"depth":34,"text":128},{"id":160,"depth":34,"text":161},{"id":224,"depth":34,"text":225},[38],"My Chrome used to check spelling for me when typing, but recently the spellcheck isn't working normally. I thought it was something related to coding, but it turns out to be just a browser setting thing.","md",{"date":277,"language":237,"comments":96},"2020-05-01","\u002Fblog\u002F2020-05-01-enable-spellcheck-on-chrome-en",{"title":120,"description":274},"enable-spellcheck-on-chrome-en","blog\u002F2020-05-01-enable-spellcheck-on-chrome-en",[283,284,285],"Chrome","HTML","spellcheck","5bZ6dvLDKP2zObTtzhVpQOCtQrKYsx9dUaYu6rzARUY",[288,293],{"title":289,"path":290,"stem":291,"children":-1,"slug":292},"Write a control panel for my API-based CMS for Nuxt","\u002Fblog\u002F2020-04-26-editor-for-my-cms-of-my-nuxt-blog-en","blog\u002F2020-04-26-editor-for-my-cms-of-my-nuxt-blog-en","editor-for-my-cms-of-my-nuxt-blog-en",{"title":294,"path":295,"stem":296,"children":-1,"slug":297},"论室友关系","\u002Fblog\u002F2020-06-07-roommate-relationship","blog\u002F2020-06-07-roommate-relationship","roommate-relationship",1794501664071]